<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_58f849907b52e99bd23af800f8d763a8229c9f259761916e6f9cd2caf9fafd1d_n0074/tu_0006> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "10. In patients with adult congenital heart disease and severe ventricular dysfunction (LVEF <35%) and symptoms of heart failure despite GDMT or additional risk factors, ICD implantation may be considered if meaningful survival of greater than 1 year is expected (S10.8-14–S10.8-16,S10.8-20)." .
